  "question": {
    "text": "In an increasing geometric progression, the sum of the first and the last term is <math><mn>99</mn><mo>,</mo></math> the product of the second and the last but one term is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>288</mn></math> and the sum of all the terms is <math><mn>189</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Then, the number of terms in the progression is equal to"
